","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"连莱卡自己都不知道，她在某些方面和埃隆很像。俩人都因为...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1034422005:1":{"key":"say:6:1034422005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1034422005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"与他们相比，我时常觉得自己很渺小。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:7:1034422005":{"key":"choice_prompt:7:1034422005","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1034422005","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"与他们相比，我时常觉得自己很渺小。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1034422006:1":{"key":"say:8:1034422006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1034422006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"很高兴被你肯定，但是请别误会，我从未被这种想法困扰。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1034422007:1":{"key":"say:9:1034422007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1034422007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我深知每一缕风都有它要去的地方，我也有自